#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versi"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "Gawe bootable USB drive nganngo coro seng gampang"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "Ganti bahasa:"

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "Pengen ngapiki terjemahan iki?"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Rufus ki sarana seng mbantu format karo nggawe USB flash drive seng iso di-"
"boot, koyo  flashdisk, memori stik, sak piturute."

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Iso digunakne utamane kanggo kasus neng ngisor iki:"

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"nggawe media instalasi USB seko ISO bootable (Windows, Linux, UEFI, sak "
"piturute.)"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "nggarap sistem seng ora diinstal OS"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "flash BIOS utowo perangkat firmware liyane teko DOS"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "pengen jalanke low-level utility"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr "Senajan ukurane cilik, Rufus nyediakne kabeh seng sampeya butuhne!"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr ""
"Daftar ISO seng didukung Rufus yo disediakne neng bagian ngesor halaman iki."

#: index.php:276 index.php:328
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Unduh"

#: index.php:329
msgid "Latest releases:"
msgstr "Rilis terahir:"

